    "NT_VERSE_REF": "2 Corinthians 5:21",
    "NT_VERSE_SNIPPET": "For our sake he made him to be sin who knew no sin, so that in him we might become the righteousness of God.",
    "OT_VERSE_LINE": "Proverbs 11:8 — “The righteous is delivered from trouble, and the wicked walks into it instead.”",
    "NT_VERSE_LINE": "2 Corinthians 5:21 — “For our sake he made him to be sin who knew no sin, so that in him we might become the righteousness of God.”",
